1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,735
SME Quote Dashboard. Which quotes came back signed this week, and what has been billed.

2
00:00:06,035 --> 00:00:19,001
It used to be a shared Excel workbook. Only one person could refresh it, by hand, and it was slow. Now the dashboard pulls about fifteen files from SharePoint automatically, and anyone can refresh it in seconds.

3
00:00:19,301 --> 00:00:24,845
This view shows the value signed back this week, by entity, against the weekly target.

4
00:00:25,145 --> 00:00:30,936
Filter the signed-back quotes to one branch, and the whole table follows.

5
00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:38,029
Click any service to open it up by agent, client and task. Click a number to see the quotes behind it.

6
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:42,924
Step back a week, and you can see at a glance whether the team beat the target.

7
00:00:43,224 --> 00:00:49,753
Every refresh is stamped with its time, and the numbers are checked against the original workbook, row by row.

8
00:00:50,053 --> 00:00:53,696
SME Quote Dashboard. A demo with made-up data.
